<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>并发编程 on Minghan的博客</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/tags/%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B/</link><description>Recent content in 并发编程 on Minghan的博客</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:41:33 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Jiangmmh.github.io/tags/%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MIT6.1810: Lab6 Lock</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-lab6-lock/</link><pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 16:41:33 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-lab6-lock/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="一memory-allocator-easy">一、Memory allocator (easy)&lt;/h1>
&lt;h2 id="1-物理内存分配器现状">1. 物理内存分配器现状&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>当前 xv6 的物理内存管理策略比较简单：&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>将可用的物理内存划分为 4KB 大小的页面。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>使用一个 freelist（空闲链表）将这些页面串联起来。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>使用一个自旋锁保护 freelist，保证多核环境下链表操作的互斥性。&lt;/li>
&lt;li>调用 &lt;code>kalloc()&lt;/code> 和 &lt;code>kfree()&lt;/code> 操作 freelist 之前先获取自旋锁，操作完成后释放锁。&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>更多细节可以参考我的&lt;a href="https://jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-02/">这篇博客&lt;/a>。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>按照实验要求，在 xv6 中运行 &lt;code>kalloctest&lt;/code>：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ kalloctest
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">start test1
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">test1 results:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">--- lock kmem stats
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">lock: kmem: &lt;span class="c1">#test-and-set 67377 #acquire() 433136&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">--- top &lt;span class="m">5&lt;/span> contended locks:
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">lock: virtio_disk: &lt;span class="c1">#test-and-set 144638 #acquire() 183&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">lock: proc: &lt;span class="c1">#test-and-set 86684 #acquire() 667829&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">lock: proc: &lt;span class="c1">#test-and-set 78406 #acquire() 667827&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">lock: proc: &lt;span class="c1">#test-and-set 72893 #acquire() 270341&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">lock: kmem: &lt;span class="c1">#test-and-set 67377 #acquire() 433136&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nv">tot&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="m">67377&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">test1 FAIL
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">start test2
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">total free number of pages: &lt;span class="m">32465&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">(&lt;/span>out of 32768&lt;span class="o">)&lt;/span>
